"Excellent! ✅ **Deployment successful!**\n\n---\n\n## 📋 STATE MACHINE DEFINITION (ASL)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"StartAt\": \"RawIngest\",\n  \"States\": {\n    \"RawIngest\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Task\",\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:states:::glue:startJobRun.sync\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"JobName.$\": \"$.RawIngestJobName\"\n      },\n      \"Retry\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.TaskFailed\",\n            \"States.Timeout\"\n          ],\n          \"IntervalSeconds\": 30,\n          \"MaxAttempts\": 3,\n          \"BackoffRate\": 2.0\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Catch\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.ALL\"\n          ],\n          \"Next\": \"RawIngestError\",\n          \"ResultPath\": \"$.error\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Next\": \"Transform\"\n    },\n    \"RawIngestError\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Pass\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"jobName.$\": \"$.RawIngestJobName\",\n        \"stage\": \"RawIngest\",\n        \"error.$\": \"$.error.Error\",\n        \"message.$\": \"$.error.Cause\"\n      },\n      \"Next\": \"PublishError\"\n    },\n    \"Transform\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Task\",\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:states:::glue:startJobRun.sync\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"JobName.$\": \"$.TransformJobName\"\n      },\n      \"Retry\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.TaskFailed\",\n            \"States.Timeout\"\n          ],\n          \"IntervalSeconds\": 30,\n          \"MaxAttempts\": 3,\n          \"BackoffRate\": 2.0\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Catch\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.ALL\"\n          ],\n          \"Next\": \"TransformError\",\n          \"ResultPath\": \"$.error\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Next\": \"Publish\"\n    },\n    \"TransformError\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Pass\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"jobName.$\": \"$.TransformJobName\",\n        \"stage\": \"Transform\",\n        \"error.$\": \"$.error.Error\",\n        \"message.$\": \"$.error.Cause\"\n      },\n      \"Next\": \"PublishError\"\n    },\n    \"Publish\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Task\",\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:states:::glue:startJobRun.sync\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"JobName.$\": \"$.PublishJobName\"\n      },\n      \"Retry\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.TaskFailed\",\n            \"States.Timeout\"\n          ],\n          \"IntervalSeconds\": 30,\n          \"MaxAttempts\": 3,\n          \"BackoffRate\": 2.0\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Catch\": [\n        {\n          \"ErrorEquals\": [\n            \"States.ALL\"\n          ],\n          \"Next\": \"PublishErrorState\",\n          \"ResultPath\": \"$.error\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"Next\": \"Success\"\n    },\n    \"PublishErrorState\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Pass\",\n      \"Parameters\": {\n        \"jobName.$\": \"$.PublishJobName\",\n        \"stage\": \"Publish\",\n        \"error.$\": \"$.error.Error\",\n        \"message.$\": \"$.error.Cause\"\n      },\n      \"Next\": \"PublishError\"\n    },\n    \"PublishError\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Fail\",\n      \"Cause\": \"Glue job orchestration failed during sequential pipeline execution\",\n      \"Error\": \"GlueJobFailed\"\n    },\n    \"Success\": {\n      \"Type\": \"Succeed\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 LEAST-PRIVILEGE IAM POLICY\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"glue:StartJobRun\",\n        \"glue:GetJobRun\",\n        \"glue:BatchStopJobRun\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"*\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✨ KEY FEATURES\n\n✅ **Sequential Pipeline**: RawIngest → Transform → Publish  \n✅ **Sync Service Integration**: Uses `.sync` suffix for job-level synchronous execution  \n✅ **Robust Retry Logic**: Up to 3 retries, 30s initial backoff, 2.0x exponential backoff for transient failures  \n✅ **Error Handling**: Catches all errors with detailed context extraction (stage, job name, error message)  \n✅ **Input Parameterization**: JobNames pulled from input via JSONPath (`$.RawIngestJobName`, `$.TransformJobName`, `$.PublishJobName`)  \n✅ **Validation Passed**: ✓ Schema and resource allowlist verified  \n✅ **Deployed**: `arn:aws:states:us-west-2:123456789012:stateMachine:t2d-demo-pipeline`\n\n---\n\n## 📥 EXECUTION INPUT FORMAT\n\n```json\n{\n  \"RawIngestJobName\": \"my-raw-ingest-job\",\n  \"TransformJobName\": \"my-transform-job\",\n  \"PublishJobName\": \"my-publish-job\"\n}\n```"
